<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/2139110e-140f-42ac-a403-bae8bd82f592> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "NFDI4Chem is an initiative to build an open and FAIR infrastructure for research data management in chemistry. The TS is a central part of the NFDI4Chem infrastructure that is currently in the making and which serves as the single point of access for NFDI4Chem services that use terminologies, controlled vocabularies or ontologies." ;
