<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/50bf739c-67ef-4950-a38e-568baba21ccc> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "NFDI4Chem is organizing a workshop on minimum information standards in polymer chemistry. We would like to have experts for polymer chemistry to participate in the development and definition of these standards – aiming for a recommendation of the results as a general practice for scientists." ;
