    dcterms:description "A short introduction to the project NFDI4Chem. It was recorded at the first \"Stammtisch\" on the Electronic Laboratory Notebook and Repository Chemotion (29/01/21) . In order to best serve the needs of the whole chemical community, the “Stammtisch” offers space for suggestions and enhancements all around Chemotion. The “Stammtisch” will be held on the last Friday of each month at 2:00 PM (CET)! Interested? Register for the next Stammtisch: https://nfdi4chem.de/index.php/event/..." ;
