<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/dc674885-081d-48f4-9562-2c1f832d767c> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    bflr:supportinghost dalia-community:bead62a8-c3c2-46d6-9eb1-ffeaba38d5bf ;
    dcterms:description """The eNanoMapper Ontology (eNMO) has undergone substantial restructuring encompassing both ontology engineering and DevOps aspects, including new automated testing and build workflows. With its continued support and active development and curation, the eNMO remains an actively used tool for open and FAIR NanoSafety data management.
The second part of the talk addresses upcoming changes in CHEMINF as we resume its active development.""" ;
